 title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1131fa8ff0b18434\" href=\"?note=1131fa8ff0b18434\" title=\"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism\">14-df-j-closed-monomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 为 LT 拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_j,e_j,\\top_j,\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\Omega_j,e_j,\\top_j,\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 的精确定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a48988fed4470569\" href=\"?note=a48988fed4470569\" title=\"14-df-fixed-truth-values\">14-df-fixed-truth-values</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(\\Omega_j,j,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)}(\\Omega_j,\\top_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(\\Omega_j,j,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)}(\\Omega_j,\\top_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：V.2 Lemmas 2–4、Theorem 5，印刷页 225–227；DjVu 第 118–119 图页。j-闭子对象的特征映射恰满足 jχ=χ，故唯一经等化子 e_j 因子化；层对象中的子对象对应环境中的闭子对象。该对应与拉回相容，给出分类子普遍性质。Ω_j 的层性质由稠密延拓和闭性获得。本项保留源证明资格，未声称机器验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-fixed-truth-values","status":"resolved","id":"a48988fed4470569","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-fixed-truth-values]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a169ef2f5263224b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"59d5dc773385bba2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-fixed-truth-values","status":"resolved","id":"a48988fed4470569","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$j$ 为 LT 拓扑；$\\Omega_j,e_j,\\top_j,\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 的精确定义见 [[14-df-fixed-truth-values]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_j,e_j,\\top_j,\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(\\Omega_j,j,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)}(\\Omega_j,\\top_j).","display":true}],"bytes":1384,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier|Theorem — 层子拓扑斯的子对象分类子]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier|Theorem — 层子拓扑斯的子对象分类子]]"},{"id":"68f3350ee8219486","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"闭包各式的证明已在[[14-df-closed-sieve]]展开，所用传递与拉回公理均为[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]。这里给出真值层的拼接证明，以免仅以[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]的抽象分类子存在断言代替具体构造。"},{"id":"8290656b9fd644b8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限极限与指数封闭已在 [[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]] 内建，闭真值分类子由 [[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]] 给出，因此满子范畴满足初等拓扑斯定义。证明不需要先假定层子范畴已经是拓扑斯。左正合反射子另由 [[14-df-separated-reflection-image]] 至 [[14-thm-lt-sheafification-adjunction]] 逐步构造：闭对角取转置、取像得到分离反射，再在层对象中取闭包得到层化。上述是原书证明的内建展开，未作证明助手验证。"},{"id":"2529efea1cd2e435","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j,a_j(A),\\eta_A$ 使用[[14-df-lt-sheafification-object]]的固定选择。$\\mathcal H=\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$，$i:\\mathcal H\\to\\mathcal E$ 是满子范畴包含函子，见[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]、[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。对满子范畴沿用环境箭头身份；$B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal H)$，$f:A\\to A'$ 为环境箭头。下式先断言对象的层性和泛性质，再据唯一描述定义箭头作用 $a_{j,1}$、函子 $a_j$ 及 $\\Phi_{A,B}$。$\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)$ 见[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]。$\\chi_U^j:A\\to\\Omega_j$ 表示由 $e_j\\chi_U^j=\\chi_U$ 唯一确定的闭子对象特征箭头。$\\chi_V^j:a_j(A)\\to\\Omega_j$ 为[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]的层分类箭头。"},{"id":"5f5d7ce8b2ae609a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]及[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]，$W_A=\\Omega_j^A$ 是层；[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]给其子对象 $S_j(A)$ 分离。核对等式可按原书的闭图像论证检验：$\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag$ 等价于 $f,g:B\\to A$ 的闭图像相同；$f$ 的图像包含于 $g$ 的闭图像，拉回后说明 $(g,f)$ 因子化通过闭对角。反向，$\\kappa_A$ 的两复合在对角上相等，又因其目标为层而在稠密的对角闭包上相等。因 $m_A$ 单，$\\kappa_A$ 与 $q_A$ 核对相同。"}],"outgoing":["a48988fed4470569","a169ef2f5263224b","59d5dc773385bba2","389620cd4ca5e1c6","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","1131fa8ff0b18434","4e6c05c92e3b9bf9"]}